   "quotes": [
    "Circ-ZNF609 originates from the circularization of the second exon of its host gene.",
    "A 753-nt open reading frame (ORF) is present in circ-ZNF609, spanning from the putative AUG of the host gene to a STOP codon created 3 nt after the splice junction (Figure 5A).",
    "Inspection of the sequence indicated that a second ATG codon was present 150 nt downstream of the first one and in the same frame.",
    "immediately upstream of the TAA codon present at position 3 in the circRNA sequence",
    "the UTR element of circ-ZNF609, spanning from the termination to the initiation codons"
   ],
