    "orf_length": "MATCH: 753 nt including the stop codon (250 aa + stop)",
    "stop": "MATCH with Results text: junction falls exactly between codons 249 and 250; codon 250 = CAA (Gln, circ[0:3]) then UGA stop at circ[3:6], i.e. the stop begins 3 nt after the junction. MISMATCH with STAR Methods wording 'TAA codon present at position 3': Ensembl sequence has TGA at 0-based circ[3:6] (1-based 4-6); circ[2:5] is ATG. Treat Methods wording as unverified/likely loose.",
